OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGales
OL,6,Fdeveloping across northern Scotland
OL,7,Fthis evening. Staying cloudy for many
OL,8,Fareas overnight, with outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain and drizzle. A spell of heavy
OL,10,Frain will move into the northwest
OL,11,Fduring the early hours. A very mild
OL,12,Fnight to come.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FHeavy rain will move
OL,15,Fsoutheastwards across England and
OL,16,FWales during the morning with blustery
OL,17,Fwinds, but turning drier and brighter
OL,18,Fin the afternoon. Heavy showers move
OL,19,Finto the north later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
